      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 2.25,
          "end": 3.9,
          "en": "Instructor: So with all these features added,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 3.9,
          "end": 6.57,
          "en": "let's make sure that we can click on a single item here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 6.57,
          "end": 9.33,
          "en": "and load it in the recipe detail section.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 9.33,
          "end": 11.52,
          "en": "Again, this is the challenge for you.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 11.52,
          "end": 14.22,
          "en": "It only uses tools we learned thus far.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 14.22,
          "end": 17.61,
          "en": "You somehow need to emit an event",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 17.61,
          "end": 22.2,
          "en": "on the single recipe item component that it was clicked",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 22.2,
          "end": 24.03,
          "en": "and then get this event",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 24.03,
          "end": 28.32,
          "en": "somehow to the recipes component,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 28.32,
          "end": 31.23,
          "en": "which then also holds the recipe detail",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 31.23,
          "end": 33.63,
          "en": "to pass down the event data",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 33.63,
          "end": 38.13,
          "en": "which recipe was selected to that component.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 38.13,
          "end": 39.33,
          "en": "Now, you're going to have to work",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 39.33,
          "end": 41.64,
          "en": "with property and event binding for this.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 41.64,
          "end": 43.98,
          "en": "Again, only things you learned thus far.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 43.98,
          "end": 46.98,
          "en": "And if you are getting stuck on something like this,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 46.98,
          "end": 50.1,
          "en": "of course we'll solve it together in a couple of seconds.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 50.1,
          "end": 51.753,
          "en": "Here's your chance to pause.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 54.57,
          "end": 56.94,
          "en": "So, were you successful?",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 56.94,
          "end": 59.79,
          "en": "Now the approach we're going to do now,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 59.79,
          "end": 63.87,
          "en": "we're going to follow now, is only a temporary approach.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 63.87,
          "end": 68.16,
          "en": "We'll later learn how to do this more elegantly and easier.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 68.16,
          "end": 69.63,
          "en": "But it's also a great approach",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 69.63,
          "end": 72.53999999999999,
          "en": "because it uses the things we learned thus far",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 72.53999999999999,
          "end": 74.4,
          "en": "and it gives us an impression",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 74.4,
          "end": 77.55,
          "en": "on when a different approach might be useful.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 77.55,
          "end": 78.75,
          "en": "So what's our goal?",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 78.75,
          "end": 81.72,
          "en": "Here, in the single recipe item component,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 81.72,
          "end": 84.39,
          "en": "here we get this link.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 84.39,
          "end": 87.39,
          "en": "And we want to make sure that whenever this link is clicked,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 87.39,
          "end": 91.38,
          "en": "we emit an event informing our parent component",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 91.38,
          "end": 94.143,
          "en": "that this recipe was selected.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 95.03999999999999,
          "end": 99.99000000000001,
          "en": "So for this to work, I'll add a click listener to this link",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 99.99000000000001,
          "end": 103.28999999999999,
          "en": "and I will say onSelected here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 103.28999999999999,
          "end": 106.89,
          "en": "Of course you can choose any method name you want.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 106.89,
          "end": 109.173,
          "en": "I'll implement onSelected here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 110.03999999999999,
          "end": 112.8,
          "en": "And there, I want to emit my own event.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 112.8,
          "end": 115.22999999999999,
          "en": "So I will name it recipeSelected",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 117.78,
          "end": 120.66,
          "en": "and this will use the EventEmitter, as you learned.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 120.66,
          "end": 124.203,
          "en": "Again, make sure to import it from @angular/core.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 125.16,
          "end": 129.12,
          "en": "The EventEmitter here won't pass any information,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 129.12,
          "end": 131.13,
          "en": "so I'll set the type to void",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 131.13,
          "end": 134.073,
          "en": "because it will contain no information,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 135.24,
          "end": 137.88,
          "en": "and we have to add @Output,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 137.88,
          "end": 141.157,
          "en": "so that we can listen to this event from outside.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 141.157,
          "end": 144.753,
          "en": "@Output also needs to be imported from @angular/core.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 145.61599999999999,
          "end": 148.216,
          "en": "In onSelected, I then want to trigger recipeSelected",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 149.88,
          "end": 153.3,
          "en": "and call emit, nope, not error, emit.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 153.3,
          "end": 155.34,
          "en": "Again, we don't pass any error",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 155.34,
          "end": 157.35,
          "en": "because here we specified that we won't.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 157.35,
          "end": 159.15,
          "en": "We don't need to pass any.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 159.15,
          "end": 160.92000000000002,
          "en": "You could argue that you want to pass",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 160.92000000000002,
          "end": 163.38,
          "en": "the recipe on which this was emitted",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 163.38,
          "end": 164.64,
          "en": "but you don't need to do this",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 164.64,
          "end": 167.823,
          "en": "because what is the parent component listening to that?",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 168.99,
          "end": 171.51,
          "en": "That of course is our recipe list component.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 171.51,
          "end": 174.57,
          "en": "That is where we use the single recipe item.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 174.57,
          "end": 177.66,
          "en": "Now, if we implement our own event here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 59,
          "start": 177.66,
          "end": 180.12,
          "en": "and listen to recipeSelected,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 60,
          "start": 180.12,
          "end": 181.83,
          "en": "well, we already got the information",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 61,
          "start": 181.83,
          "end": 183.93,
          "en": "which recipe this will be",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 62,
          "start": 183.93,
          "end": 186.87,
          "en": "because we have it here from the ngFor loop.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 63,
          "start": 186.87,
          "end": 188.7,
          "en": "Keep in mind this will replicate this element,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 64,
          "start": 188.7,
          "end": 191.97,
          "en": "so for each element, it's absolutely clear,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 65,
          "start": 191.97,
          "end": 194.55,
          "en": "well, which element it is.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 66,
          "start": 194.55,
          "end": 198.66,
          "en": "In recipeSelected, we again need to emit an event though",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 67,
          "start": 198.66,
          "end": 201.36,
          "en": "because we're not there where we want to be.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 68,
          "start": 201.36,
          "end": 203.76,
          "en": "We have to go up one level",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 69,
          "start": 203.76,
          "end": 206.43,
          "en": "because we want to reach our recipes component,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 70,
          "start": 206.43,
          "end": 208.95,
          "en": "which is the one implementing the recipe list.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 71,
          "start": 208.95,
          "end": 212.34,
          "en": "This is probably where you see that this is kind of complex",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 72,
          "start": 212.34,
          "end": 214.65,
          "en": "to simply inform another component",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 73,
          "start": 214.65,
          "end": 216.39,
          "en": "that we clicked something.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 74,
          "start": 216.39,
          "end": 218.67000000000002,
          "en": "For now, it's the only method we have",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 75,
          "start": 218.67000000000002,
          "end": 220.35,
          "en": "and it's a great practice.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 76,
          "start": 220.35,
          "end": 223.86,
          "en": "But no worries, we will improve this in the future.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 77,
          "start": 223.86,
          "end": 226.35,
          "en": "So in recipe list, we need to emit another event.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 78,
          "start": 226.35,
          "end": 229.41,
          "en": "So here, I'll execute onRecipeSelected.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 79,
          "start": 229.41,
          "end": 231.213,
          "en": "Of course, choose any name you want.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 80,
          "start": 232.47,
          "end": 236.31,
          "en": "And that method of course has to be implemented here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 81,
          "start": 236.31,
          "end": 239.222,
          "en": "Now, here we need to get some extra information,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 82,
          "start": 239.222,
          "end": 242.01,
          "en": "which recipe was selected,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 83,
          "start": 242.01,
          "end": 246.03,
          "en": "and therefore I will pass the recipeElement here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 84,
          "start": 246.03,
          "end": 249.033,
          "en": "So that is the recipe which we did select.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 85,
          "start": 251.07,
          "end": 252.96,
          "en": "Now that we have that information,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 86,
          "start": 252.96,
          "end": 255.63,
          "en": "we know here we will get the selected recipe,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 87,
          "start": 255.63,
          "end": 257.97,
          "en": "which will be of type recipe.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 88,
          "start": 257.97,
          "end": 259.59,
          "en": "We're already importing the model,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 89,
          "start": 259.59,
          "end": 261.84,
          "en": "therefore we can easily use the type.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 90,
          "start": 261.84,
          "end": 265.59,
          "en": "And then we, as I mentioned, want to emit another event.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 91,
          "start": 265.59,
          "end": 268.23,
          "en": "So here, we need to find a fitting name.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 92,
          "start": 268.23,
          "end": 271.35,
          "en": "Before, we used recipeSelected.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 93,
          "start": 271.35,
          "end": 273.57,
          "en": "That would be a fitting name here too,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 94,
          "start": 273.57,
          "end": 276.63,
          "en": "but to make it super clear that this is a different event,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 95,
          "start": 276.63,
          "end": 278.94,
          "en": "because custom events don't propagate up,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 96,
          "start": 278.94,
          "end": 283.94,
          "en": "so we can't listen to the event of a child of a child,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 97,
          "start": 284.88,
          "end": 288.6,
          "en": "I want to choose a different name, recipeWasSelected maybe,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 98,
          "start": 288.6,
          "end": 290.79,
          "en": "which also uses the EventEmitter,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 99,
          "start": 290.79,
          "end": 294.72,
          "en": "so make sure to import it from @angular/core.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 100,
          "start": 294.72,
          "end": 298.5,
          "en": "And here, I will pass my recipe as a type.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 101,
          "start": 298.5,
          "end": 301.05,
          "en": "Here, I will pass the recipe which was selected",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 102,
          "start": 301.05,
          "end": 303.09,
          "en": "because that is the information",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 103,
          "start": 303.09,
          "end": 307.11,
          "en": "the recipes component will need in the end.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 104,
          "start": 307.11,
          "end": 311.04,
          "en": "Now as before, we need to add @Output here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 105,
          "start": 311.04,
          "end": 313.53,
          "en": "and import this from @angular/core,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 106,
          "start": 313.53,
          "end": 316.023,
          "en": "so that we can listen to this event from outside.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 107,
          "start": 317.01,
          "end": 319.41,
          "en": "And then here in onRecipeSelected,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 108,
          "start": 319.41,
          "end": 323.91,
          "en": "we can use recipeWasSelected, emit it,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 109,
          "start": 323.91,
          "end": 327.78,
          "en": "and pass the recipe as data.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 110,
          "start": 327.78,
          "end": 330.69,
          "en": "Now with that, we can go to our recipe component,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 111,
          "start": 330.69,
          "end": 333.81,
          "en": "our main component for this feature area,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 112,
          "start": 333.81,
          "end": 337.11,
          "en": "and on the list, we can now listen to recipeWasSelected,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 113,
          "start": 337.11,
          "end": 340.2,
          "en": "the custom event we created a second ago,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 114,
          "start": 340.2,
          "end": 344.43,
          "en": "and here, I now want to store this selected recipe.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 115,
          "start": 344.43,
          "end": 347.13,
          "en": "So in my TypeScript file,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 116,
          "start": 347.13,
          "end": 351.57,
          "en": "I will create a selectedRecipe property,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 117,
          "start": 351.57,
          "end": 353.73,
          "en": "which will be of type Recipe.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 118,
          "start": 353.73,
          "end": 357.87,
          "en": "Make sure to import Recipe from your model file then.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 119,
          "start": 357.87,
          "end": 359.73,
          "en": "And initially, this is undefined",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 120,
          "start": 359.73,
          "end": 361.623,
          "en": "because I'm not assigning a value.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 121,
          "start": 362.58,
          "end": 365.67,
          "en": "I will assign a value here once this event here occurs,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 122,
          "start": 365.67,
          "end": 370.2,
          "en": "so then I will set selectedRecipe equal to $event.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 123,
          "start": 370.2,
          "end": 372.57,
          "en": "And of course you could also put this into a method",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 124,
          "start": 372.57,
          "end": 374.49,
          "en": "but since this is all I want to do,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 125,
          "start": 374.49,
          "end": 376.5,
          "en": "I can put it into the template here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 126,
          "start": 376.5,
          "end": 378,
          "en": "Generally though, you should try",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 127,
          "start": 378,
          "end": 381.72,
          "en": "to put as little logic as possible into your template.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 128,
          "start": 381.72,
          "end": 384.09,
          "en": "So here, I'm referring to the selectedRecipe property",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 129,
          "start": 384.09,
          "end": 386.07,
          "en": "of my recipes component,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 130,
          "start": 386.07,
          "end": 388.26,
          "en": "and $event, as you learned,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 131,
          "start": 388.26,
          "end": 391.14300000000003,
          "en": "refers to the data we passed with an event.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 132,
          "start": 392.01,
          "end": 395.19,
          "en": "Now, we can pass this information",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 133,
          "start": 395.19,
          "end": 398.043,
          "en": "to the recipe detail component.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 134,
